Subject: [PATCH] Patch: Update animations, menu, color grading, character, camera, and joystick

- Animations: refined character and world animations for smoother movement and transitions
- Menu: polished side pause menu layout, styling, and open/close transitions
- Color grading: adjusted scene lighting and color tones for a warmer farm look
- Character model: updated the player character's model and proportions
- Camera: improved camera follow, rotation, and view behavior
- Joystick: tuned the virtual joystick's responsiveness and touch handling
